The SLC620 In-wall Mechanical Switch provides remote on/off control and enables scheduling for automatic switching, with 1~4 channel options.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA 1.2 compliant
- Remote on/off control
- Enables scheduling for automatic switching
- 1~4 channel on/off
- 86 x 86 x 47mm standard in-wall size
